window.products.push({"id":316022,"name":"Rose Gold 21st Birthday Decorations Party Supplies Gifts for Her - Create Unique Events with Happy Birthday Banner, 21 Number and Confetti Balloons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TG3dQga8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Made of food grade material, safe and non-toxic   Strong and light, can float with helium filled   Can be reused, use the straw to deflated balloons after party ends   Package Incudes:  HAPPY BIRTHDAY BANNER x 1  12\" Rose Gold Latex Balloons x 16   12\" Rose Gold Confetti Balloons x 8   40\" Number 2 Foil Balloons x 1  40\" Number 1 Foil Balloons x 1   16\" Star Mylar Balloons   Balloons Ribbon x 1 (11 yards) Why Helium balloons deflate so quick? Because helium atoms are smaller than air, they slip between spaces in the balloon material.  There is less space between the molecules in Mylar, so the balloon stays inflated longer. How long will balloons float? Research shows average float time is 5-7 hours.  Float time can vary significantly based on the level of inflation,size of balloon, temperature and altitude.  We recommend inflating balloons  1-2 hours prior to the event for the best results. What can I do to make latex balloons float longer? First, be sure to tie a tight knot in the neck of the balloon.   If you are attaching ribbons to the balloons, be sure to tie the ribbon below the knot.   For special occasions that require prolonged float time, you can also purchase float extender like ULTRA HI-FLOAT to expend float time to 1 week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TG3dQga8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brillex","source_asin":"B07J6G3PR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J6G3PR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J6G3PR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
