window.products.push({"id":316035,"name":"RTTECH Window Film Privacy One Way Mirror Window Tint for Home Sun UV Blocking Heat Control Daytime Privacy Solar Film Static Cling for Residential Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmr2BDJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Window film the privacy effect will be different as the light and angle changes. 2.Single plane fluoroscopy:One-way perspective refers to the strong light intensity side can't see the dark side of the light, which means when indoor light is stronger than outdoor, people outside can see people inside.In general,people outside can't see people inside during daytime. 3.Different effect between daytime and night:The outside glass will show a mirror effect as well as keep your privacy during daytime, when evening indoor light is stronger,then the glass outside will lose mirror effect as well as outside people can see inside. 4.Mirror effect:The mirror effect we said means it has a slightly reflective effect,not totally like a mirror. 5.Peel off the backing transparent protective film, paste the film to the window and use your hand to press it from the top down so that it can tightly attach to the surface, put protective film on window film before squeegee away water and air bubbles,prevent damaging window film.Installation steps: 1. Clean the Windows. 2. Tear the PET protective film of the product; 3. Spray plenty of water on the Windows and on the side where the protective film is torn; 4. Paste the product; 5. Use a scraper to scrape off excess water. TIPS: Bubbles may occur during the pasting process. ! ! 6. Use a scraper to scrape off excess water bubbles and ensure that there is no gap between the product and the glass. The product can be firmly stuck on the window, so as not to cause falling! ! ! 7. Use a knife to cut off excess around the edges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmr2BDJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTTECH","source_asin":"B08C27S9DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C27S9DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C27S9DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
