window.products.push({"id":316039,"name":"NC, Frogfit Sherpa Fleece Blanket Queen Blanket -Navy 400 GSM Large Size Double Supper Thickness Warm Lightweight Fuzzy Soft Luxury Microfiber Bed Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M5FjeWptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. 100% Microfiber Polyester. 2.Our blankets can keep you warm, both front and back, and you can put it on the bed as a cushion,Whether you are in the living room, bedroom, living room, office and outdoor, you can always use it to keep warm and make you comfortable.3.Unique Design Philosophy: Fleece Bed Blanket Brings You More Breathable And Lightweight Feeling Than Regular Cotton Blanket Throw To Keep Your Body Warm - Neat Stitches Enhance Strong Connections At Seams And Better Structural Strength With Integrated Outlook - Double Design Offers You Different Senses Of Softness To Improve Your Sleep.4.We provide you with three different specifications and five different colors of blankets. You can buy Blankets according to different scenes and people. For example, you need to keep your legs warm in the office. You can choose the Medium /small size, and the bedroom can choose the Large size, including different groups of people.5.What You Can Get: Available In Sherpa Fleece Blanket King Size,Navy,Machine Wash In Cold Water On A Gentle Cycle. Caution: No Fabric Softener. Tumble Dry With No Heat, Delicate Cycle. Do Not Dry Clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M5FjeWptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B08X7B9T4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X7B9T4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X7B9T4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":316040,"name":"ShadePix Window Shade - Blackout Window Shade with Available in Size 10 x 36 Peaks Modern Pattern Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JRjncWHgL._AC_SL1390_.jpg","description":"Inside Mount: Inside Mount refers to a window shade that is mounted on the inside of your window frame. This type of mount is by far the most common and is highly recommended. An Outside Mount is generally only used if there are obstructions inside of your window-frame (e.g. an alarm sensor) or if your window frame is not deep enough to hold your shade. You will need at least 2.5 inches to install your shades with an Inside Mount. When measuring, it is important to use a steel measuring tape and round down to the nearest 1/4 of an inch increment. STEP 1: Measure the width of your window; rounding down to the nearest 1/4 inch increment. This will be the width you will order. Please do not make any changes to this measurement. If your measurement is not an exact inch measurement (for example, 35.25 inches), please order the next size up (36 inches in this case) and send us an email with your exact measurement. If we do not receive an email within 2 hours the order placement, we will produce the shade to the size ordered. Outside Mount: Outside mount shades are mounted outside the window opening on either the wood trim frame or adjacent flat surface area. You will need at least 3 inches of flat space is around your window to install your shades. When you specify an outside mount, we will not take any size changes – unless you have contacted us to change the width of the shade within 1 inch of the measured size. STEP 1: If you have a frame or trim around your window, simply measure to the far edges of your trim from left to right. If your window opening has no trim around it, measure a distance from point A to point B that includes any extra width you may desire for light gap coverage and privacy. We recommend adding 2-3 inches to each side. This will be the width that you will order. Please contact us with any questions or concerns. ~Product SKU # WS-1919-0-1-0-0-10x36-116 ~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JRjncWHgL._AC_SL1390_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windowpix","source_asin":"B079Z16GPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079Z16GPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079Z16GPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":316041,"name":"Maizeco Vintage Cat Metal Tin Sign A Woman Can’t Survive on Books Alone Metal Sign Decoration 8x12 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IrjthCQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does everyone wonder how to creatively bring your love for sports and recreation to life in your home and do so in a decorative way? Incorporating the use of sports signs and recreation signs can be the answer that you were looking for. Creating a more personal décor for your home or business means that you bring in a part of yourself, your interests no matter what they may be.Our love for sports or recreation is a part of who we are and we want to share it with others that we invite into our home. Often we open the doors to sharing out interest with others find a new ground in which to relate to our visitors or customers. No matter what sport we love, you will be able to find sports signs to display, and even after the season for that sport is over the signs will allow you to keep it alive all.Using Vintage signs at our places of business draws the attention of our customers as soon as they the door and often creates a conversation that will help relax your customers and create a friendlier business relationship. Also adding sports signs and vintage signs to our business will make us look more human.If your business is one that requires the customers to wait for service, the sports signs will give them something to look at, maybe they will have memories that come to life looking at the sign. It could help create a conversation between your customers as they wait, thus help to pass the time away.The key to decoration using sports signs and recreation signs is to allow yourself to relax and bring a piece of you to life. No matter what area you are wishing to use the sign in there will be a way to use and use it with class. Maybe the mixture of vintage signs and today’s signs will show how our business or our favorite sport has grown over the years. Creative decorating brings a part of us out in our homes and business and make it more comfortable for not only our visitors but ourselves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IrjthCQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maizeco","source_asin":"B09N8QSBLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8QSBLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8QSBLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
