window.products.push({"id":316090,"name":"Howard Miller Original II Wall Clock 620-313 – Antique & Round with Quartz Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wkTQj69mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: The Original II Wall Clock honors the past from Old-World clock masters, who plied their special trade in Germany's Black Forest region, while focusing on the future. It is authentic to the first timepieces Howard Miller produced and will compliment your home decor. DURABLE: This indoor rustic clock is created to last. It has a sturdy frame to relieve stress in a busy household. Display it in your kitchen, office, bathroom, bedroom, living room, and more. HIGH QUALITY: This vintage wall clock is a home essential. Easily tell time with an antiqued pendulum, beautiful antique dial mounted on laser-cut panel base and black hands. The clock’s quartz movement makes a soft ticking noise without the use of chimes for a quieter environment. DIMENSIONS: The diameter of this clock is 13 inches (33 cm) with a height of 18.5 inches (47 cm), and a depth of 1.75 (4 cm). It is powered by quartz movement and requires two AA sized batteries (not included). Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wkTQj69mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B001BYOZQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001BYOZQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001BYOZQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
