window.products.push({"id":316147,"name":"JefDiee Inflatable Travel Foot Rest Pillow, Kids Airplane Bed, Adjustable 3 Layers Height Leg Rest Pillow, Adults Travel Essentials Great for Airplane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aXwsKl8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✈️COMFORTABLE JOURNEY EXPERIENCE: Versatile inflatable foot rest pillow is high perfect line up with the airplane seat height to elevates the legs for greater comfort. Fill the gap between two seats with this airplane foot rest to increase the rest space. With the travel foot rest for airplane, make kids sleep better, or is a platform for kids to play with toys and relax. Adults can also inflatable pillow from the cushion to have the options to change sitting position, sit cross legs, bent legs. ✈️UNIQUE HUMANIZED DESIGN: This inflatable leg rest has two separate air chambers. The lower chamber for 1-level height, and the upper chamber for 2-level height. With 2-in-1 double valve, the upper black air valve is a one-way air inlet for inflating or replenishing gas. Bottom transparent air valve can be quickly inflated and deflated. What's more, the double valve is designed for mouth blowing, It only takes about one or half minutes with a few breathes. Release the air only 3-5 seconds. ✈️SOFT AND DURABLE: The travel footrest pillow are made of washable soft PVC flocking. The portable foot rest is tear-resistant for long term use and comfortable touching. There's also a removable washable drawstring bag so you always have a clean surface. The airplane travel essentials weights only 0.8lb. Can be folded into a 7\"x4\"x2\" drawstring bag to carry around and inflat to a 17\"x15\"x9\" sitting/ floating cubes whenever you need. We don't have to worry about it taking up space. ✈️HEALTH KEEPER: The airplane footrest can be adjusted to three different heights and can be adjusted to suit your own use according to your comfortable posture. Help your feet and legs get rest after tiring work, or long time travel on the Train, Bus and Airplane. Improve your blood circulation and reduce swelling by raising your legs. Help in reducing the risk of DVT (Deep Vein Thrombosis), in relieving back pain since sitting for long period of time. ✈️RELAX ANYWHERE: Generously wide, the travel foot rest pillow can be used vertically or horizontally for optimal support in an airplane, in a car or in a trains to relieve strain and fatigue. Our travel foot rest pillow can be used for foot rest in the office or at home. And even use it to support your feet while watching TV or reading on the sofa so you can relax wherever you are!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aXwsKl8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JefDiee","source_asin":"B0BL3KKF45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3KKF45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3KKF45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
