window.products.push({"id":316296,"name":"You Is Kind. You is Smart. You is Important. Aibileen Clark - Reclaimed Repurposed Art Sign 10-in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19jyPNjKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please read the following before purchasing: Because these signs are constructed of reclaimed materials, we cannot guarantee strict uniformity in color, shade, or finish of wood. It is not uncommon for signs to be slightly darker or lighter in shade, to have remnants of paint, nail holes, or for wood to not be perfectly aligned. These imperfections are an inherent quality of these signs and bring out the rich heritage and history of the wood with which they are constructed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19jyPNjKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Second Nature By Hand","source_asin":"B01BK3P0VO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BK3P0VO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BK3P0VO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":316297,"name":"Antique Brass Wrist Sundial Compass Watch Vintage Directional Magnetic Sundial Compass Wrist Marine Nautical Compass Navigation Survival Instrument St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WK64tvB5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether You Are Preparing For An Outdoor Adventure Or An Emergency Situation, Compass Is An Essential Piece Of Gear. Featuring A Glow-In-The-Dark Face, You Will Be Able To Read The Direction In Any Weather Condition. Additionally, The Antique Look Adds A Classic Feel That Never Goes Out Of Style. Perfect For The Prepper In Your Life, Compass Keeps You On The Right Path And Offers Peace Of Mind That No Matter What Comes Your Way, You Are Ready. Our Compass Has Been Called A Hiker's Dream! The Compact Design Makes It Easy For Smaller Hands To Handle And Offers The Convenience Of Easily Storing In Your Emergency Survival Supplies. You Should At Least Carry A Compass If Not A Topo Map As Well. A Detailed Topo Map And A Compass Are Still The Primary Tools For Navigation In The Wilderness. A Compass Helps You Orient The Map, Identify Land Features And Locate Your Position. So Whether You Are Out With The Boy Scouts Or Lost In The Woods, Will Be Your Guide. The Accurate Compass Measures Azimuth, Deflection Angle, Level Measurement, Length And Height Measurement Of Objects, And Easily Reads Data Anytime, Anywhere, Perfect For Camping, Hiking, Exploring, Hunting And Other Outdoor Activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WK64tvB5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global Collection","source_asin":"B09RWK1VZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RWK1VZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RWK1VZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
