window.products.push({"id":316351,"name":"KANGYA In Oven Digital Meat Thermometer,Updated Dual Probe Instant Read Oven Safe with Alarm Function Big Back-light Screen Magnetic Portable for Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kIyYTLsvL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Game Changer - KANGYA Updated Design Dual Probes Leave in Oven-Safe Digital Food Thermometer Features ★ Being frustrated by overcooked meat, turkey, or steaks? This updated meat thermometer fits the bill.  ★ It provides a easy, fast, accurate reading with ℉/℃ switchable, large back-lit screen and beep alarm function.  ★ The built-in foldable probe is long enough to be able to insert into the meat without burning your fingers.  ★ Surprisingly! The extra 39-inch wire probe can be left in the oven to provides you an accurate inner temp of the meat.  ★ Kindly note the main body part cannot be leave in the oven.  ★ It comes pre-calibrated, and it can be re-calibrated with ice water to assure accurate reads. ★ With built-in magnetic design, you can attach it on any metal surface around for easy storage and access. Warm Tips ★ Practice makes perfect. To enjoy your cooking time with this food thermometer, pls read the User Instruction firstly and get some practices beforehand.  ★ To care for this food thermometer, pls wash the metal probe gently and keep it dry. (Avoid immersing the body part completely in water.) Packages ★ 1 x Food Thermometer (User Guide Included) ★ 1 x CR2032 Battery ★ 2 x Food Grade Stainless Probes Things You Should Know: Q: Can you leave the thermometer body in the oven?  A: Nope, ONLY the wired stainless probe part can be leave in the oven.  Q: Can you measure cake or milk temp with this thermometer?  A: Yes, this instant read meat thermometer also works for baking, liquids and many other foods.  Q: How to change the battery?  A: Don’t worry, you use a coin to open battery compartment on the back. Once battery is secured, press down and twist the door back on. Piece of cake! Feel free to contact us if any questions, KANGYA Team is always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kIyYTLsvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOMAVER","source_asin":"B08CKG8JRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKG8JRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKG8JRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
