window.products.push({"id":316393,"name":"Makeup Stencil Swatch Stickers by No Drama Beauty - 10 Cutouts - 10 Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jvbw1TwZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style: Basic 10 Stencils  Quantity: 10 Sheets Sheet size: 16.1 x 5.9 cm Cut out area: 4.5 x 1.2 cm Material: Vinyl, low tack adhesive for skin Use: One-time use How to apply:Clean and dry the desired area to remove any oils and dirt to allow the adhesive to attach properly. This will prevent makeup from bleeding underneath the sticker. Carefully peel the stencil away from backing by using one of the easy peel corners.  Place the stencil adhesive side down on the desired area, apply light pressure on the stencil until fully adhered to the skin.Apply the desired product and wait for the product to dry. When the product is dry, peel back the stencil slowly. Warning : Patch test prior to use. Remove the product from skin immediately if you experience irritation and discontinue use. Caution: Keep out of reach of children. Connect with us: IG: NoDramaBeauty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jvbw1TwZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"No Drama","source_asin":"B0875RYGSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0875RYGSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0875RYGSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
