window.products.push({"id":316413,"name":"EFLYING 4 Pack 20 Oz Beer Can Glass with Bamboo Lid & Straw Regular Mouth Can Shaped Clear Drinking Glass Soda Coke Cans Tumbler Beer Glasses Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znFDL9fOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Can Shape Cup Design】Our set comes with 4 can-shaped 20oz drinking glasses, 4 bamboo lids with airtight silicone ring, 4 silver stainless steel straws, 1 straw brush and a jar brush. Beer can glass set of 4 is designed with a modernly crafted can shape to mimic the traditional aluminum beer can, easy-to-hold, suitable for bars, coffee shops，restaurants dining，home，parties and more occasions like birthdays, weddings， house warming and gifts. 【Perfect for All Beverages】 Our glass pint drinking glass set comes with 4 silver stainless steel boba straws with a 1.2cm/ 0.5inch diameter straw hole, the thick straw size allow dense beverages such as smoothies, slushies, yogurt to easily come through. Extra drink ingredients such as boba pearls and fruit pieces can easily through the straw. Regular mouth caliber of 2.6 inches diameter, it is convenient and also large enough for you to clean the interior glass with the included jar brush. 【Dishwasher Safe High-quality Durable Glass】These glass cups with bamboo lids and straws are designed for both hot and cold drinks in mind. With a sturdy non-slip design base and smooth can shaped glass design，this water borosilicate glass tumbler can withstand high heat and sudden changes in temperature between hot and cold temperature range. 【Environmental Friendly Bamboo Lids】Bamboo lids for beer can glass provide a secure silicone sealing gasket, matching the regular mouth can glass to create best airtight seal and prevent leaks,locking in food freshness. To keep the lid of the clear soda glass cans sealed, we use a thicker silicone ring. When using the lid, screw it into the bottle and continue to rotate it clockwise before releasing it to prevent if from popping out. 【Easy to Keep Clean】Our 20 oz beer glass are made of high quality, sturdy, thick glass which has a smooth interior that will not absorb food, coloring or odors. Natural bamboo lids with silicone rings can prevent rust and deformation, all materials are BPA and PVC free and meet food safety standards. The silicone rings can be detached from the bamboo lids with strawholes easily. After using, please detach and clean the parts separately and keep dry to avoid mildew.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znFDL9fOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFLYING","source_asin":"B09TP55T6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TP55T6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TP55T6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
