window.products.push({"id":316570,"name":"Blackout Cordless Patterned Window Shades, Roller Shades Printed with Vincent Van Gogh's Works, Premium UV Protection Custom Room Darkening Blinds for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81weHHmMSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: Van Gogh collection patterned window shades, light up your window with the famous painting. Blackout fabric blocks 100% light and UV ray,light filtering fabric allows light come in but not see through,brightening the room while still preserving privacy. Window blind front is art printing,back is white color. Cordless design is safe for children and pets,gently pull or push bottom bar to control shade.Motorized roller shades controlled by remote.Multicolored top Valance is available. ORDER CONFIRMATION: Select the group, which includ the pictuure you like, then click the \"Customize Now\" bottom to click your favorite printed image to place order, leave all the information according to the instructions as detailed as possible. We will send email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please make sure you will reply email timely. If we don't get your reply in 48 hours, we will make the shades as your order customizations. INSIDE MOUNT: Inside mount require a MIN 2\"(if with valance need MIN 4\")window frame depth. You need choose the exact WINDOW inside width and height to place order, then WE will minu 0.25\" (the mounting space) base on your window width to the final shade width. For example, if your window inside are 35.75\" wide by 42\" high, select 35\" W and 12/16 as the order width, select 42\"H as the order height, the shade you get is 35.5\" Wide (total shade is 35.5\"W, actual fabric is 34.3\"W ) by 42\" High. OUTSIDE MOUNT: The shade width and length should be 3\" to 10\" wider than window for better coverage. You need choose the exact SHADE width and height to place order. For example, if your window is 40.75\" wide by 58\" height, the shade should be at least 44\"wide and 63\" high, you need to select 44\" W and 63\" H to place order. We will make no deduction, you will get the exact shade size you ordered 44\"W by 63\"H. For outside mount, if there is enough space, the bigger the better. SHIPPING: WE DO NOT DELIVER TO PO BOX and APO ADDRESSES. Courier companies do not deliver to PO boxes and the shades are to long for Post. Please provide your delivery address. Couriers deliver 9am-5pm weekdays and ask to sign Proof of Delivery, so it could be your work address too. When you shop with us, we will do our best to make your project be a success. No matter if you made a mistake or there are other issues, you will be covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81weHHmMSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B0B638GF9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B638GF9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B638GF9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
