window.products.push({"id":316617,"name":"Chard FG800SS 8 Meat Grinder, 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GiSZqOAwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CHARD #8 Electric Grinder eliminates the hard work when making sausages, burgers and brats. The 400 Watt motor and oversized hopper allow you to grind generous portions of meat in a short amount of time, quickly and efficiently. The reverse auger function helps to prevent jamming and ensures continuous use. The heavy-duty cast cutting blade and sintered steel fine and medium plates can process up to 2.5 pounds of meat per minute. The hopper and grinder head assembly are removable for easy clean up. Includes one sausage stuffing tube and three stuffing plate attachments. CHARD Products put you in control with a little help from the right tools. From meat processing, to outdoor cooking, to simple food preparation, we help you Make It Yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GiSZqOAwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chard","source_asin":"B00HCC245I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HCC245I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HCC245I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":316618,"name":"1500W Smart Electric Space Heater - 16\" Electric Heater with Wi-Fi & Bluetooth App Control, 80°Oscillation Ceramic Heater with Overheat Protection for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K4pvje0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌡️ Control Remotely via App: Download the app on your phone to turn on the space heater, even when away from home, so you'll always return to a warm space. Dual use of 2.4G WiFi & Bluetooth App Connection makes network distribution easier and faster. Tips: 2.4G WiFi ONLY, please check the Qucik Start Guide(WiFi Connection) if you have any doubts. 🌡️ Fast Heating: Powerful 1500W PTC ceramic heating allows this space heater to heat up in seconds, making you feel the change from cold to warm in a matter of seconds. Suitable for warming up spaces in the home including bedrooms, basements, garages, living rooms, and can also be used in offices, dorms, hot yoga studios. 🌡️ Heat Cover More Area: Unlike other heaters that only have a 70 ° oscillation, Our space heater are designed with a 90° oscillation, meaning that the warmth can be covered to more areas. This electric heater has a louvered air outlet design, and you can freely adjust the up and down air direction with the knob on the side. 90° oscillation + up and down adjustment will greatly meet your heating needs. 🌡️ Quiet Heating: 45dB - almost as quiet as a library. The fan wheel uses oblique airflow technology, which effectively reduces wind noise and makes the room heater 12% quieter than traditional electric heaters. Calm airflow lets you sleep soundly and work undisturbed during the cold winter. 🌡️ Portable and Convenient Use: The detachable and washable filter on the back effectively prevents dust accumulation and odor from heating. The touchscreen is placed on top of the heater for easier reach, and the 16-inch compact design and the hidden carry handle make our space heater easy to move around. Simply plug the electric heater into a wall outlet, adjust the mode you want and enjoy the warmth from the space heater. 🌡️ Multiple Safety Protection: No worry about your baby or pets knock down the electric heater by accident. ETL-listed portable heater comes with multiple security features including overheat and tip-over protection. The heater sensor will auto switch off when tipped over and when it reaches to 122°F, and also stop operation after 24h in case that people forget shutting down the power.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K4pvje0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acekool","source_asin":"B0BFWLH9SD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFWLH9SD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFWLH9SD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
