window.products.push({"id":316653,"name":"DURASPACE Futon Chair Bed Convertible Chair 3-in-1 Pull Out Sleeper Chair Beds with USB Ports, Armchair Bed Sleeper for Living Room (Black Faux Leathe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":364.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F6m0KIkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏚️ 【EASY CONVERSION】A pull-out sleeper chair can be a great space saver in a dorm room, small apartment, or tiny house. An area that's a living room by day can quickly and easily be transformed into a sleeping space at night. All you have to do is pull out the sleeper feature, get the blankets and sheets out of the storage footstool, and settle down for a good night's rest. 🏚️ 【ADJUSTABLE BACKREST】The backrest of the sofa bed is adjustable within 3 reclining angles (110°, 140°, 180°) so that you can choose the perfect angle you like to accompany your work, leisure, and relaxation time all day long. You can adapt to different scenarios from different angles, whether you want to be sitting, lounging, or sleeping. 🏚️ 【PREMIUM MATERIAL】The folding couch is made of a high-quality steel frame, ensuring best durability in daily use and can withstand 330 lbs. The couch bed’s breathable linen fabric and high-density sponge helps you release the whole body from head to feet. There are built-in cup holders and side pockets to meet your daily needs. We are committed to integrating multiple humanized designs to create more convenience for your life. 🏚️ 【USB AND CUP HOLDERS】 There are 2 USB charging ports on the left armrest of the sofa for various charging cables, which can provide continuous power supply for your phone. There is a convenient cup holders design on the seat back to place drinks and cups. There are 2 side pockets and built-in cup holders to meet your daily needs. 🏚️ 【STORAGE & PILLOW】Small, extra storage space under the footrest can perfectly fit pillows or organize your clutter. There are throw pillows for extra comfort in your neck and lumbar while reading, watching television, and sleeping. 🏚️ 【OVERSIZE ARMCHAIR】Single Chair Dimensions: 39\" W x 33\" D x 34.5\" H; Seat Size: 28\" W x 23.2\" D x 17.7\" H; Chaise Lounge Dimensions: 39\" W x 60.5\" D x 34.5\" H; Single Bed Dimensions: 39\" W x 73\" D x 17.7\" H. Weight limit: 330 lbs. Super easy to assemble, only takes several steps. Material: Steel, wood, Faux Leather & high-density foam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F6m0KIkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DURASPACE","source_asin":"B0BKL55T7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKL55T7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKL55T7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
