window.products.push({"id":316667,"name":"LOVSPA Pink Sands Potpourri Refresher Oil | Jasmine, Orange Blossom, Gardenia, Lemon, Green Tea, Pear, Amber, Vanilla & Sandalwood | Scented Oils for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QJx-Y3rnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Pink Sands is a blend of both modern and traditional notes of intoxicating Jasmine, Orange Blossom, Gardenia, Amalfi Lemon, Green Tea Leaves, Sparkling Pear, White Musk, Amber, Sweet Vanilla and Sensual Sandalwood. Everyone loves a sweet-smelling home, but just keeping it sparkling clean isn't always enough. Scented candles are nice, but they may not be the best choice for every home. Potpourri and fragrance oils have been used as a natural way to freshen homes for centuries. Eventually the scent fades from an open dish of potpourri, and it can be expensive to replace. Not to worry. Potpourri refresher oils are readily available, and you can use them in a variety of ways to add fragrance to your home. ⭐The same wonderful essential oils that are used in our candles and reed diffusers are now also available to refresh your potpourri. ⭐ Currently available in CALM, REFRESH, UPLIFT, ROMANCE and PINK SANDS. Use the inner dropper to spruce up the fragrance just before a party, or toss the potpourri in a plastic bag with half or the entire bottle. Ideal for use on potpourri, our handcrafted refresher oils radiate fresh, engaging home fragrance throughout your space. Potpourri refresher oils contain very strong, concentrated essential and fragrance oils that may harm wood surfaces & clothing. Display potpourri in a glass, ceramic or metal container, bowl or vase. LOVSPA Fragrances is a leading lifestyle fragrance brand offering a variety of exceptional home fragrance and spa related products geared toward stress relief and relaxation. LOVSPA products are made in the USA with rich, lasting fragrances. Give any space a luxurious ambiance and love the air around you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QJx-Y3rnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVSPA","source_asin":"B079NHSXLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079NHSXLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079NHSXLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
