window.products.push({"id":316761,"name":"Liven Electric Grill Indoor Hot Pot SK-J6860 Multifunctional, Indoor Teppanyaki Grill/Korean BBQ/Shabu Shabu Hot Pot, 3.6L Capacity for 2-10 People","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XQlVGAe5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1-year manufacture warranty Feel free to contact us if there is any quality problems. Price Match Guarantee: If you find a current lower price within 15 days after purchase, just bring in the proof and we will adjust your payment to the lower price, upon request. CLEANING AND MAINTENANCE 1.Please unplug the power plug before cleaning and wait for the product to cool down completely before washing.  2.Clean the surface of the pot body and electric baking tray with wet cloth, a little detergent can also be put in. The product cannot be soaked in water for cleaning.  3.The oil receiving box can be cleaned with detergent in water.  4.Do not use any wire balls to clean the inside or outside, in case to damage to the coating.  5.Do not put the whole product soaked in water for cleaning.  6.After cleaning, put it in a ventilated place to dry, ensure the surface of the next use is dry. SAFETY CAUTIONS 1.Avoid circuit overload use this product, do not operate another high power product in the same circuit.  2.The temperature of this product can be adjusted, but the marked electrical rating must be at least greater than that of this product.  3. Before connecting the product to the power supply, please make sure that the voltage of the product is consistent with the local power supply voltage. NOTES: 1.Do not use this product to cook or defrost food, all food must be completely thawed before use.  2.This product may produce some smoke at the beginning of use, which is normal and will disappear with further use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XQlVGAe5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVEN","source_asin":"B08BZPR667","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-316761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZPR667","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZPR667","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
